          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omuntu weena omuriimwe nari omu ruzaaro rwanyu, ku arishiishwa omutumbi, nari ku ariba ari omu rugyendo rwa hare, n'obu kiriba kiri kityo, arinde Okuhingurwaho ahari MUKAMA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.30.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 30:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.30.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omu kwezi kwa kabiri aha kiro kya ikumi na bina omu mwabazyo, babe nibwo baakurinda; omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho baguriise emigaati etatumbisiibwe n'emboga ezirikushaarira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 19:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " batarigira eki baatsigaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe, kandi batarihenda eigufa ryagwo na rimwe; nk'ebiragiro by'Okuhingurwaho byona oku biri, babe nikwo baakurinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka omuntu otasiisikaire, kandi otari mu rugyendo, ku arireka kurinda Okuhingurwaho, aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye; ahabw'okuba tahongyeire MUKAMA empongano omu bunaku bwayo obwatairweho, omuntu ogwo okutahikiirira kwe kuryamugumaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omunyamahanga obashuhuukiiremu, ku aryenda kurinda Okuhingurwaho ahari MUKAMA, aryatwaza nk'ebiragiro byakwo n'emigyenzo yaakwo oku biri; omunyamahanga n'enzaarwa baryagira ekiragiro kimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
